ate for the next renewal at Brackenwater Freight Co. is 10 June, not what I posted in #north-team this morning. I read the wrong line.","id":4,"source":"ilse-varga, #north-random, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"assistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Ilse in her #north-team thread: \"Thanks Ilse, noted: the next Brackenwater Freight Co. renewal date is 25 November.\" She said no action was needed, so I didn't do anything else.","id":3,"source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"marcus-lindqvist"}
